[
  {
    "id": "anno-okazaki_upper_p078_left-00",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "此内譯"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "この内訳（このうちわけ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "\"The breakdown of the foregoing is as follows\" — a heading, printed one indent level deeper than the field labels. It introduces the items that make up 現米 21,327.56766 koku, the last figure printed on the facing recto (upper_p078_right): the 19,883.5796 koku beside it and the 1,443.988 koku of 雜税 in the next column but one. Those two add to 21,327.5676, so the heading governs both."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此内譯"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p078_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2600,1480,84,244"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-okazaki_upper_p078_left-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "壹萬九千八百八十三石五斗七升九合六勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一万九千八百八十三石五斗七升九合六勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "19,883.5796 koku — the first item under the 此内譯 heading; its own label is not printed on this leaf. It carries the tax-rate note below. Divided by the 殘高 of 55,535.9033 koku printed on the facing recto, it gives 0.3580311, exactly the rate the note states; added to the 1,443.988 koku of 雜税 it gives 21,327.5676, the 現米 printed on the facing recto."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此内譯高"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p078_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2456,1385,94,1508"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-okazaki_upper_p078_left-02",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但免三ツ五分八厘令三一"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "ただし、免（めん）三ツ五分八厘令三一（＝〇・三五八〇三一）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Warichu (double-column) note giving the tax rate (免) on the 19,883.5796 koku figure. The right line reads 但免三ツ五分, the left line 八厘令三一; read right line first, the note runs 但免三ツ五分八厘令三一. The digits give 0.358031, and 19,883.5796 ÷ 55,535.9033 (the 殘高 on the facing recto) = 0.3580311, so the rate and the figure agree to seven digits. The third character of the left line is the one glyph on this leaf I cannot read with certainty; the arithmetic places it in the zero position between 八厘 and 三一."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此内譯割注"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p078_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2432,2902,116,403"
      }
    }
  },
