        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous taxes, rice portion: 1,443.988 koku; the cash portion follows in the next column. This figure plus the 19,883.5796 koku two columns to the right add to 21,327.5676, which is the 現米 printed on the facing recto."
