      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Buddhist clergy: 878 persons as printed. The male and female sub-counts below come to 873, five short of it. The population breakdown continues on the next leaf (upper_p079_right), which prints 穢多 97 and 非人 142; with those added, every category across the two leaves sums to 52,814 — the stated 人員 — only if the clergy figure is 873. The printed 878 is therefore the single figure in the return that does not reconcile, and it is recorded here as printed."
